# Build output for a lesson: regenerable from the script + the workspace.
# Wistia is the delivery surface for MP4s; the repo keeps scripts, workspaces
# and status records. Kept here rather than in design-system/.gitignore so a
# lesson workspace is never silently untracked.
#
# Exception (owner decision 2026-08-03): narration.words.json IS tracked. The
# workspace alone gives you the visuals; the word timings are what drive every
# entrance, so without them a retained workspace can be looked at but not
# faithfully edited — re-synthesizing narration yields slightly different
# timings and silently re-times the whole composition. It is a small text file;
# the MP3 and the MP4 stay out. Written as `audio/*` rather than `audio/` so
# the negation below can take effect (git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded).
lessons/**/audio/*
!lessons/**/audio/narration.words.json
lessons/**/render/
